  "details": "Going off the same idea of allowing world creators to edit the height features in their worlds directly from the VRChat website, I think it would be neat to also let creators set a \"recommended world height\" that players can toggle in their height menus. A lot of adventure maps already have an avatar height recommendation at the start of their maps, I think it would be convenient to just click a button and automatically be resized. \n\nIf you're playing as a tall avatar and you're in a world that was build off of a 4'11 avatar scale; the world creator can set 4'11 to be the recommended world height directly from the VRChat website; and you as your tall avatar can select the option to be resized to that height",
